<title>USA: Morgan Cty BOE, Ala., won by Sterne, Agee &amp; Leach.</title>
<headline>Morgan Cty BOE, Ala., won by Sterne, Agee &amp; Leach.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterne, Agee &amp; Leach, Inc said it won $3.62 million of Morgan County Board of Education, Ala., school tax refunding warrants, series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.789 percent.</p>
</text>
